  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "n-p1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -230,
      "w": 1200,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "PUBLIC SITE AND JOINING\nEverything a visitor sees before they are a member, desktop on top and mobile below.\nThe two screens ending in 'wrong address' and 'link expired' are part of the set, not edge cases \u2014\nthey are the two things that will actually happen."
    },
    {
      "id": "n-p2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -260,
      "w": 1400,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "MEMBER AREA \u2014 THE WHOLE SECTION\nNine screens on desktop, the same nine at 390px on the row below, then the two onboarding states,\nthen the component sheet everything is built from.\n\nThis is the area a member lives in. The rule running through all of it: the member never maintains their own record.\nSkills are derived, certificates arrive, activity accumulates. The only things they ever fill in are settings and a profile they chose to make public."
    },
    {
      "id": "n-p2b",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -90,
      "w": 1400,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Order left to right: Dashboard \u00b7 My events \u00b7 Certificates \u00b7 One certificate \u00b7 Skills \u00b7 My opportunities \u00b7 Activity \u00b7 Profile \u00b7 Settings"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-p3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -230,
      "w": 1200,
      "page": "page-3",
      "text": "EXECUTIVE AREA \u2014 ONLY THE MEMBER REVIEW SO FAR\nThis is the next section to work through in full: overview, members, events, attendance,\ncertificate issuing, opportunity review, content and analytics.\nWhat is here is the member-approval part, built earlier."
    },
    {
      "id": "n-p4",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -230,
      "w": 1200,
      "page": "page-4",
      "text": "NOT YET REWORKED\nTwo early phone screens belonging to sections we have not reached: the public event detail page,\nand the executive attendance capture screen. Both get done properly, desktop and mobile,\nwhen their section comes up."
    }
  ],
